  advancement, and pending-bit state transitions are those performed by
  `readBits`; the region adds no state.
- **Required sequencing and state:** The `readBits` read happens first; the
  sign adjustment operates only on its returned value. Successive calls
  continue the shared bit stream in order, so callers'"'"' interleaved
  `readBits`/`readSBits` sequences stay aligned on the stream.
