  magic `__wakeup()` method itself) and a direct `$criteria->__wakeup()` call on
  a live instance — are exercised by the existing callers. Callers additionally
  assert ownership:

      (new ReflectionClass("CDbCriteria"))->getFileName() === "/app/framework/db/schema/CDbCriteria.php"

  so a pre-declared shadow class, or a class loaded from any other path, does not
  satisfy them.

