- **Observable behavior:** Decodes one MS-ADPCM packet into `m_framesPerPacket × channelCount` interleaved `int16_t` samples (`channelCount = m_track->f.channelCount`, 1 or 2).
- **Inputs:** `encoded` — packet bytes; `decoded` — sample destination; retained members `m_track`, `m_framesPerPacket`, `m_coefficients` (`int16_t [256][2]` pairs).
